      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Мы попросили магнитных друзей открыть портал между нашим миром и миром, откуда пришло это эхо.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, искренняя серьёзность",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 6160,
      "sha256": "cb2ed390da8601689194123db58e5c07a8224c6ce6a08ba08262d61cc2d5d64c"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P04_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Значит, вы меня спасли?",
      "emotion": "потрясение, надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 2320,
      "sha256": "dd1719fde8143092382c733dc7197f216ee6e256f0ad99a3e1b4175b461749d2"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P04_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Не совсем так. Попробуй отправиться к «Последним вратам». Там ты найдёшь больше ответов.",
      "emotion": "мягкая поправка, напутствие",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 6000,
      "sha256": "4d9c82a26e5ac4b5f78000e82f47ca3c10b20aa427959e8ecd2e3ba29b65bb2b"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P04_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "exclamation",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Удачи!",
      "emotion": "ободряющее пожелание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 1280,
      "sha256": "33a634b089c8b0d198d7bc043c7a9099f7ae99005ae4f500bbd74297dc7fa369"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P04_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "4, 5",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Мика открыл глаза и понял, куда лететь. Он попрощался с командой и вместе с новым другом отправился к Перекрёстку миров.",
      "emotion": "осознание, переход к путешествию",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 8320,
      "sha256": "677e3c855c321b99c20127c8b90319e617b0a49c11cf91df03bb5cff2d6df47f"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P04_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "У Перекрёстка миров нейронный друг вновь связался с Микой. Чтобы воспользоваться артефактом, нужно разгадать ребус.",
      "emotion": "сюжетное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 7280,
      "sha256": "43305a5970762db4fcdf3abd2ba4e3aea6d310cd8a9e4399d958063bcd0bbc98"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P04_L007_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L007",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "7",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Мы и сами не знаем, куда приведёт артефакт. Я отправлюсь с тобой. Изучать неизведанное — наша цель.",
      "emotion": "открытость неизвестному, решимость",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 6880,
      "sha256": "db0181047142d11400b6428f783786d8629dfd75ff9e6bc97e399b8200ddee9e"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH06_P04_L008_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L008",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "8",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Впереди открылся проход, и Мика направил свой звёздолёт в него.",
      "emotion": "решимость, открытый финал",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 4400,
      "sha256": "b84d441f72002819d7f2e5e108531b3044ec127ad592bb46c321892c0375a4af"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P04_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "We asked our magnetic friends to open a portal between our world and the world where the echo came from.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, искренняя серьёзность",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 5840,
      "sha256": "0a2f9f8e6ba9a582463bfb96ccb12cfc26c33a3cabb07ad032d3b12a70d65de8"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P04_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "So you saved me?",
      "emotion": "потрясение, надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 1920,
      "sha256": "f76e6cec91fe93ff94ec66ea7d9eafa832fdea97bd93e7a6dc92ba6bd2a00200"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P04_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Not quite. Try going to the Last Gates. You’ll find more answers there.",
      "emotion": "мягкая поправка, напутствие",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 5360,
      "sha256": "7d265f9a0b589aa83a04242ebddafe47b4651b976de46122bd09c04591233e98"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P04_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L004",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "exclamation",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Good luck!",
      "emotion": "ободряющее пожелание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 1200,
      "sha256": "fb7b8c9acc6fa33f956b99247dac0b247c82b0d14ab8303cbe43d3c51bd2efae"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P04_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L005",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "4, 5",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika opened his eyes and knew where to go. He said goodbye to the crew and set off for the Crossroads of Worlds with his new friend.",
      "emotion": "осознание, переход к путешествию",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 8560,
      "sha256": "d8ffd81e3cade1e6c39052de9f864aec7e9e2a79d64c3a0878d4c589d5ae8261"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P04_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "At the Crossroads of Worlds, his neuron friend contacted Mika again. To use the artifact, he had to solve a puzzle.",
      "emotion": "сюжетное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 7760,
      "sha256": "ac7a6e4da4a88cc4b0ebc1f211bab4a1e00bf3e953c2c99ea0df1c744b22bf40"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P04_L007_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L007",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "7",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Even we don’t know where the artifact leads. I’ll come with you. Exploring the unknown is our purpose.",
      "emotion": "открытость неизвестному, решимость",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 6160,
      "sha256": "defb1694c8db510443c7c0e81efdc124e0e83bf41d312db309aa4a5e3e4af7ae"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH06_P04_L008_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L008",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "8",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "A passage opened ahead, and Mika steered his starship into it.",
      "emotion": "решимость, открытый финал",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 4400,
      "sha256": "856a7ffd8c9843eca7fac7c1758ea88e8327eb8b98383a74dc637d8bdc2fb1f0"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P04_L001_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L001",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Pedimos aos nossos amigos magnéticos que abrissem um portal entre o nosso mundo e aquele de onde veio o eco.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, искренняя серьёзность",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 6800,
      "sha256": "ffc42a62dbd7053444baaa480634b205a2453834596fe521f58ea8fb2c8e8328"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P04_L002_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L002",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Então foram vocês que me salvaram?",
      "emotion": "потрясение, надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 2560,
      "sha256": "14514e6d6cf0ad9f52d950617564c4ec745f78bc8028a2e03dd45a1cb43c4f74"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P04_L003_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L003",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Não exatamente. Tente ir até os “Últimos Portais”. Lá você encontrará mais respostas.",
      "emotion": "мягкая поправка, напутствие",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "sha256": "7974a83d4abe0ac4039bd6fdcce446d3c0b4f02420ea63d06d76c3d29b148b25"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P04_L004_pt_BR.mp3",
