      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "exclamation",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Boa sorte!",
      "emotion": "ободряющее пожелание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 1520,
      "sha256": "9644ea63f78794bbe437a5ce2237fb5308a70ce999f975a1748b5a5aa7cd1478"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P04_L005_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L005",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "4, 5",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika abriu os olhos e soube para onde ir. Despediu-se da equipe e partiu com seu novo amigo rumo à Encruzilhada dos Mundos.",
      "emotion": "осознание, переход к путешествию",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 8480,
      "sha256": "7a0e9a64350e2a18726d7c4cdde402f7f028745590c28734c3c7e18933313f90"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P04_L006_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L006",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Na Encruzilhada dos Mundos, seu amigo neural voltou a falar com Mika. Para usar o artefato, era preciso resolver um enigma.",
      "emotion": "сюжетное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 8160,
      "sha256": "d65823870210da252922e919167cb08299bf01c8be6abbcea3babc75c4960b75"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P04_L007_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L007",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "7",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Nem nós sabemos aonde o artefato leva. Vou com você. Explorar o desconhecido é nossa missão.",
      "emotion": "открытость неизвестному, решимость",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 6000,
      "sha256": "268b2b9f2da5f5c949d22db7c9349810a1589e0a14d6d21faf7c969f8906e98c"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH06_P04_L008_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L008",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "8",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Uma passagem se abriu à frente, e Mika guiou sua nave para dentro dela.",
      "emotion": "решимость, открытый финал",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 4800,
      "sha256": "7476eeaee9ca01dea756aa08e546e1d3a144c07b7be5887aabd85b8fc797aa3c"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P04_L001_es.mp3",
