      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika abrió los ojos y supo adónde ir. Se despidió de la tripulación y partió con su nuevo amigo hacia la Encrucijada de los Mundos.",
      "emotion": "осознание, переход к путешествию",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 8720,
      "sha256": "9f19f8f12eab5238c4563628bb88609f483c3889e042849c6a5727e9f737abde"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P04_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L006",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "En la Encrucijada de los Mundos, su amigo neuronal volvió a contactar con Mika. Para usar el artefacto, tenía que resolver un acertijo.",
      "emotion": "сюжетное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 8480,
      "sha256": "e5f40ae54cf4eb074467c9886840181437ba9da19ec74b5c59a005bc862f914f"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P04_L007_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L007",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "7",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Ni nosotros sabemos adónde lleva el artefacto. Iré contigo. Explorar lo desconocido es nuestra misión.",
      "emotion": "открытость неизвестному, решимость",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 6960,
      "sha256": "94e1e52eb93f5aad027fbbfe2d25a19375ae3181e8758b1e45dda4dc69953266"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH06_P04_L008_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L008",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "8",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Se abrió un pasaje ante él, y Mika dirigió su nave hacia su interior.",
      "emotion": "решимость, открытый финал",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "sha256": "545e7fa6ce8636ee5c1ff7d5b077067edb3fa8f6463d8fe8c164dded5d038457"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P04_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Nous avons demandé à nos amis magnétiques d’ouvrir un portail entre notre monde et celui d’où venait cet écho.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, искренняя серьёзность",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 6320,
      "sha256": "5d87d11f04b29e5f2d4784e2f6e9707fbb8654354eb5bcad7d46c5ebda6ba776"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P04_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Alors, vous m’avez sauvé ?",
      "emotion": "потрясение, надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 2080,
      "sha256": "83852a155655be459b2ef2357577f185421ef65c8b7e3574e3c28f698ae3ad14"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P04_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Pas tout à fait. Essaie de rejoindre les « Dernières Portes ». Tu y trouveras plus de réponses.",
      "emotion": "мягкая поправка, напутствие",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 5440,
      "sha256": "0301aa61c2eb73d68a3889fb08bddfcbad591179ccfe8aa35a66ff0ee302307a"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P04_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "exclamation",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Bonne chance !",
      "emotion": "ободряющее пожелание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 1440,
      "sha256": "c947e00696165d4ea489d0e5cac81e0e688858a61a0b9adda6dd19d9e905bb3d"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P04_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L005",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "4, 5",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika ouvrit les yeux et sut où aller. Il fit ses adieux à l’équipage et partit avec son nouvel ami vers le Carrefour des Mondes.",
      "emotion": "осознание, переход к путешествию",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7600,
      "sha256": "284fcd811f19a557a225a885075aa49f8458c7155b56ecec8f2df7b772da7d11"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P04_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Au Carrefour des Mondes, son ami neuronal reprit contact avec Mika. Pour utiliser l’artefact, il fallait résoudre une énigme.",
      "emotion": "сюжетное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 7360,
      "sha256": "78061d32507b38845055eb33849996d0ac45932cc56478d94d966325567ed3e1"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P04_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L007",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "7",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Nous ignorons aussi où mène cet artefact. Je pars avec toi. Explorer l’inconnu est notre raison d’être.",
      "emotion": "открытость неизвестному, решимость",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 6320,
      "sha256": "b535e831c54cb6fea85db8718f3b553c4e5031805e3a93e1ff1aa11b40d725cf"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH06_P04_L008_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L008",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "8",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Un passage s’ouvrit devant lui, et Mika y guida son vaisseau.",
      "emotion": "решимость, открытый финал",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 4000,
      "sha256": "db97ace65b327cf54c2f14eccf3f77c664365eba3f3f8165bf753c4eb3a57f1b"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P04_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Wir baten unsere magnetischen Freunde, ein Portal zwischen unserer Welt und der Welt zu öffnen, aus der das Echo kam.",
      "emotion": "объяснение, искренняя серьёзность",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7200,
      "sha256": "39d754d0176681f33210c6f0593bd5dd6cf1228a148d915a9feab7de2b394108"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P04_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Habt ihr mich also gerettet?",
      "emotion": "потрясение, надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 1600,
      "sha256": "f57807032ea1831ed18b306657d7bf78546f0eee3d3da7e147900f11125ca1e8"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P04_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Nicht ganz. Flieg zu den „Letzten Toren“. Dort findest du mehr Antworten.",
      "emotion": "мягкая поправка, напутствие",
      "emotion_tag": "[gently]",
      "duration_ms": 5040,
      "sha256": "552d174d1c77ec175e0df6df007f8f008b5620b820f3493cec9edd5816e72f2c"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P04_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "3",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "exclamation",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Viel Glück!",
      "emotion": "ободряющее пожелание",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 1360,
      "sha256": "1d04121996bb29e36ef6b905a625f92902bb0f32bc9029053eb9d1f276420fe4"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P04_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L005",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "4, 5",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika öffnete die Augen. Nun wusste er, wohin. Er verabschiedete sich von der Crew und flog mit seinem neuen Freund zur Kreuzung der Welten.",
      "emotion": "осознание, переход к путешествию",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 9120,
      "sha256": "63591b040a983432297f00deb632db3fb28dc5b2e1342dba186a24c30e3d1cca"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P04_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "An der Kreuzung der Welten meldete sich sein neuronaler Freund wieder. Um das Artefakt zu nutzen, musste er ein Rätsel lösen.",
      "emotion": "сюжетное объяснение",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 7600,
      "sha256": "a1655c676ba577d6968d59690e0f048d36ef794b0c62b3c234a993d17b64faa2"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P04_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L007",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "frame_id": "7",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_038",
      "role": "neuron_telepathic_voice",
      "kind": "offscreen_neuron_speech",
      "voice_id": "FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5",
      "text": "Auch wir wissen nicht, wohin das Artefakt führt. Ich komme mit. Das Unbekannte zu erforschen ist unser Ziel.",
      "emotion": "открытость неизвестному, решимость",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 6560,
      "sha256": "990e3304be754aa865c8b27b099402f7df5120f2e6ca062b297b1a80c1d5d76c"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH06_P04_L008_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH06_P04_L008",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "frame_id": "8",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Vor ihm öffnete sich ein Durchgang. Mika steuerte sein Raumschiff hinein.",
      "emotion": "решимость, открытый финал",
      "emotion_tag": "[determined]",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "sha256": "e0b7fd7b677df588feeb29b40ae8c03162412942255691f72899bb97d814582c"
    }
  ],
